---
// The public address has no screen of its own: signed-in users go to the app interior, others to sign-in.
// Set on Astro.response instead of `return Astro.redirect(...)`: a top-level return in frontmatter
// crashes @typescript-eslint/no-misused-promises in astro-eslint-parser.
Astro.response.status = 302;
Astro.response.headers.set("Location", Astro.locals.user ? "/dashboard" : "/auth/signin");
---
